        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dina Meyer, James Wan, Leigh Whannell\n- Franchises: Saw\n- Companies: Lionsgate, Twisted Pictures\n- Films: Deception, Starship Troopers, Birds of Prey\n- Roles: Barbara Gordon, Dizzy Flores, Detective Allison Kerry\n\nFacts:\n- Dina Meyer was born on December 22, 1968, and she is an American film and television actress.\n- Dina Meyer played Dizzy Flores in Starship Troopers.\n- Dina Meyer played Barbara Gordon in Birds of Prey.\n- Dina Meyer played Detective Allison Kerry in the Saw films.\n- Saw is an American horror franchise created by James Wan and Leigh Whannell.\n- Saw is distributed by Lionsgate and produced by Twisted Pictures.\n- Saw consists of eight feature films and additional media.\n- Deception is a 2004 Canadian-American television film starring Dina Meyer.",
